mode: "100644"
text: "# Streams, sequencing + two worked examples\n\n## Revenue-stream menu (stability / margin / external tool)\n| Stream | Stability | Margin | Best for | Runs in (external) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Membership / community | high (recurring) | high | consistency | Patreon, Passes, Skool, Discord |\n| Digital products / courses | medium (repeat) | very high | structured expertise | Gumroad, Payhip, Stan |\n| Paid challenges | medium (cohorts) | high | front-end funnel | community platforms |\n| Sponsorships / brand deals | low–medium | high | reach + trust | brand-deal platforms / direct |\n| Platform funds / ad-rev | low (bonus) | n/a | scale (bonus only) | YouTube/IG/LinkedIn native |\n| UGC for brands | medium | high | small accounts | direct / UGC marketplaces |\n| Merch | medium | medium | identity/affinity | Printful, Fourthwall, Spring |\n| Affiliate / tips | low–medium | varies | supplement | affiliate networks / tip tools |\n\n## Sequencing (don't do all at once)\n**Own audience → recurring core → 1 digital product → selective sponsorships → funds as bonus.** Add a\nstream only when the prior one is steady. Aim for **≥3 streams** for resilience.\n\n## Realistic math (ranged + caveated — never a promise)\n```\nRecurring core: 2-4% of an engaged email/audience base may convert to a paid tier.\nExample (illustrative, NOT a promise): 5,000 engaged followers x ~3% x $10/mo ~= $1,500/mo recurring,\n   highly variable by niche/engagement/offer. Pair with 1 digital product for margin.\nPlatform fund: treat as a bonus (TikTok Creator Rewards ~ $400-1,000 per MILLION qualified views; ~10k-follower gate).\n```\n\n## Sponsorship media-kit essentials\nAudience size + **engagement rate** + niche/demographics + **best-performing examples** + **attribution/\nROI** from past deals + clear rates + contact. Price on engagement/ROI, not follower vanity. **Disclose\n(#ad).** Align with audience or skip.\n\n## Worked example 1 — recurring core + product (blunt indie-founder voice)\n```\nCREATOR: 8k engaged followers, freelance-tax niche, strength = structured expertise.\nSTACK: recurring core = $9/mo \"tax-tips community\" (Skool); product = \"freelance tax course\" (Gumroad).\nSPONSORSHIP: selective, accounting-tool brands only, disclosed. FUNDS: ignore (too small to matter).\nPROMO (WoopSocial publishes): launch + weekly value posts -> link-in-bio / comment->DM. EXPECTATION: ranged, not promised.\n```\n\n## Worked example 2 — small-account start (warm studio voice)\n```\nCREATOR: 800 followers, bookkeeping. Platform funds = negligible -> ignore.\nFIRST: grow the email list (-> email-and-newsletter) + sell one $29 template to the most engaged few (Payhip).\nALSO: UGC-for-brands (paid for content, not influence). EXPECTATION: 1K-10K ~ $100-1k/mo, highly variable; set a learning goal.\n```\n\nBoth: diversified stack matched to strengths; recurring core first; ranged expectations (never promised);\ninfrastructure external; WoopSocial publishes only the promo posts; sponsorships disclosed; metrics from\nthe external tools (never fabricated).\n"
